# game/ep5.rpy:276
translate chinese ep5_fe4e497a:

    # d "{i}She talks pretty fluently now, unlike other kids out there that still have trouble communicating. And she can comprehend a wide range of topics very easily too.{/i}"
    d "{i}其他孩子交流起来多少还有些困难，但她说话已经非常流利了。而且她还能很快地理解很多话题。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:277
translate chinese ep5_1f65261e:

    # d "{i}But I won't know for sure until she starts studying for real and meet other kids around her age.{/i}"
    d "{i}但最好还是看看她在遇到其他同龄孩子之后，以及真正开始学习之后的表现吧。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:278
translate chinese ep5_bf3247b4:

    # d "{i}*giggles* Jeez... My little Emy sure is growing up fast! Maybe I should stop using baby talk and talk to her in a more natural way.{/i}"
    d "{i}*笑* 哎呀……我的乖女儿长得可真快！可能我之后不能再用哄小孩的语气跟她说话了。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:281
translate chinese ep5_5742bb13:

    # em "I want to meet her, I want to meet her!"
    em "我想见她！妈妈，我想见她嘛！"

# game/ep5.rpy:282
translate chinese ep5_a725cac2:

    # d "Don't worry, sweetheart. I can't say for sure because she's a very busy person, but I'm sure she will visit us one of these days."
    d "别急呀，宝贝。夫人很忙的。但我跟你保证，她过段时间一定会来看我们的。"

# game/ep5.rpy:283
translate chinese ep5_64c40924:

    # em "I can't wait~! *giggles*"
    em "我等不及了~！ *笑*"

# game/ep5.rpy:284
translate chinese ep5_74d1ef17:

    # d "For now, why don't you go back to your seat? The food is almost ready."
    d "好了，先回座位上去吧。饭马上就做好了。"

# game/ep5.rpy:285
translate chinese ep5_ee179392:

    # em "Okay~!"
    em "好~！"

# game/ep5.rpy:288
translate chinese ep5_bf29426c:

    # d "{i}Now, I'll just have to cut this and-{/i}"
    d "{i}把这个再切一下就——{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:292
translate chinese ep5_b45ae0cf:

    # d "!!!"
    d "！！！"

# game/ep5.rpy:295
translate chinese ep5_5e7618c1:

    # d "Ngk!"
    d "啊！"

# game/ep5.rpy:298
translate chinese ep5_b7039a1a:

    # d "*huff* *huff*"
    d "*喘气* *喘气*"

# game/ep5.rpy:301
translate chinese ep5_dac50c4f:

    # d "*sighs*..."
    d "*叹气*..."

# game/ep5.rpy:307
translate chinese ep5_8a23d6dd:

    # "A month later..."
    "一个月后……"

# game/ep5.rpy:316
translate chinese ep5_58103e77:

    # d "As always, thank you for looking out for my daughter while she's here, Mrs. Smith."
    d "感谢你一直以来对我女儿的照顾，史密斯老师。"

# game/ep5.rpy:317
translate chinese ep5_c34ba360:

    # ms "No worries, Mrs. Meyer. I know it's my job, but it's also my passion to guide all these lovely children towards the right path."
    ms "不用谢，梅耶女士。我热爱我的工作，非常乐意把这些可爱的孩子们领向正确的道路。"

# game/ep5.rpy:320
translate chinese ep5_67f84acd:

    # ms "...However, I can't help but still be slightly concerned about her."
    ms "……不过，对你的女儿，我还是略微有些担忧。"

# game/ep5.rpy:321
translate chinese ep5_351906ea:

    # d "Why? Is there any problem with her?"
    d "为什么？她有什么问题吗？"

# game/ep5.rpy:322
translate chinese ep5_accc56d8:

    # ms "It's been a month since I started teaching these kids. But she's different from the rest of them. She's extremely smart and way more mature than others her age."
    ms "我开始给这些孩子们上课已经一个月了。通过这一个月的观察，我发现她跟班里其他孩子都很不一样。她太聪明了，举止都很成熟，不像这个年纪的孩子。"

# game/ep5.rpy:323
translate chinese ep5_7f1f502d:

    # ms "I did ask her a couple of tricky questions, to try and test my theory. I was certain the other kids would be unable to answer them, but Emy? She quickly answered without hesitation."
    ms "我为了测试还问了她几个很刁钻的问题，我很确定其他孩子都答不上来。但是艾米毫不犹豫地就答对了。"

# game/ep5.rpy:324
translate chinese ep5_5944be3c:

    # ms "Kids her age have this habit of usually taking a second or two to think before answering something. But she's not like that."
    ms "这个年龄的儿童一般在回答问题之前都有思考几秒钟的习惯。但是她不会。"

# game/ep5.rpy:325
translate chinese ep5_0b53fb8b:

    # ms "It's fair to assume that she's as bright as a normal 7 or even 8-year-old."
    ms "我觉得她目前的智力水平可能已经跟7、8岁的孩子相当了。"

# game/ep5.rpy:328
translate chinese ep5_ca1f906e:

    # ms "Have you noticed that at all before? Was she at least showing some signs?"
    ms "你之前注意到这些了吗？她之前有表现出什么征兆吗？"

# game/ep5.rpy:329
translate chinese ep5_2801c713:

    # d "I did... At age three, she started to learn how to hold a pencil. Then, when she reached four years old, she already knew how to hold one properly."
    d "我确实注意到了……她三岁的时候就学会怎么握笔了。之后到了四岁，她就能流畅地用笔画画、写字了。"

# game/ep5.rpy:330
translate chinese ep5_c82aae59:

    # d "Seeing this, I tried to teach her how to memorize the alphabet and how to write her own name too. I was flabbergasted to see her master all this in a matter of weeks."
    d "我发现之后就开始教她字母表，还有教她写自己的名字。她只用了不到一个星期就学会了。"

# game/ep5.rpy:331
translate chinese ep5_30416fa9:

    # d "And when she reached five, she could already talk to me fluently, without stuttering. She could comprehend things easily just by watching them happen."
    d "五岁的时候她就能流利地跟我交流了，完全不会吞吞吐吐的。而且不管看到什么事情都能很快理解。"

# game/ep5.rpy:332
translate chinese ep5_5dc4e81b:

    # d "That's when I knew she wasn't like the other kids her own age. I then decided to stop talking to her in 'baby talk' and started talking to her maturely."
    d "这时候我才发现她跟同龄的孩子都不一样。之后我就用自然的语气跟她说话，而不是用哄小孩的语气了。"

# game/ep5.rpy:333
translate chinese ep5_44b7c943:

    # d "...Is... it a bad thing for her?"
    d "……这……对她来说是坏事吗？"

# game/ep5.rpy:334
translate chinese ep5_53fa4cbc:

    # ms "No, I'm not saying it's a bad thing. But the way she thinks and acts is unlike any other kids here. This makes it hard for her to properly socialize with them."
    ms "不，我没有那个意思。但是她现在思考还有行动的方式都跟其他孩子不一样。所以她在班级里的社交就会很困难。"

# game/ep5.rpy:335
translate chinese ep5_71d773b4:

    # ms "At this age, children need to socialize and learn from each other. This is also the age where they start having friends to play with."
    ms "这个年龄的儿童必须社交，然后彼此之间互相学习。所有儿童都是从这个年龄开始交朋友的。"

# game/ep5.rpy:336
translate chinese ep5_639ade92:

    # ms "With Emy's situation, I'm afraid that she might shy away from them or the other way around. "
    ms "但以艾米目前的情况，我害怕她会无法融入。"

# game/ep5.rpy:339
translate chinese ep5_ce45621f:

    # ms "But don't worry, Mrs. Meyer. With that in mind, I'll try my best to help her however I can."
    ms "但你不用太担心，梅耶女士。我现在已经知道了她的情况特殊，所以我会尽全力帮她的。"

# game/ep5.rpy:340
translate chinese ep5_c98cad39:

    # d "Thank you, Mrs. Smith."
    d "谢谢你，史密斯老师。"

# game/ep5.rpy:341
translate chinese ep5_9744ea8c:

    # ms "I'm also thinking of making a request to move her a few grades up, for the next school year."
    ms "我也已经向学校申请让她从下个学年开始就跳级了。"

# game/ep5.rpy:342
translate chinese ep5_57d26ccc:

    # ms "With her intelligence, I'm sure she can compete with higher grade students without any problems."
    ms "以她的表现来看，我确信她即使在高年级的孩子里也能脱颖而出。"

# game/ep5.rpy:343
translate chinese ep5_34274b61:

    # d "Please do. If it's beneficial to her, I won't have any complaints with it."
    d "我明白了。如果对她有好处的话，我不会有任何意见。"

# game/ep5.rpy:344
translate chinese ep5_dd1b06ee:

    # ms "That's good to know. Although, I'll still need to observe her some more and see what she is really capable of."
    ms "那就好。不过，我得继续观察她的表现，好知道她的能力具体到什么程度。"

# game/ep5.rpy:345
translate chinese ep5_3781c67a:

    # d "You have my gratitude, Mrs. Smith. I'll leave her in your care for now. I'll come back to get her at the end of the school day."
    d "非常感谢你，史密斯夫人。我就把她交给你了。今天放学之后我再来接她。"

# game/ep5.rpy:346
translate chinese ep5_464d8390:

    # ms "Sure, Mrs. Meyer."
    ms "好的，梅耶女士。"

# game/ep5.rpy:349
translate chinese ep5_01e33b90:

    # d "Emy... Mom will be back later to fetch you, alright? I'll just go to the supermarket to buy something for us to eat later."
    d "艾米……妈妈之后再回来接你，好吗？我得先去超市买东西了。"

# game/ep5.rpy:350
translate chinese ep5_74e6b8aa:

    # em "Hm... Don't be late, okay?"
    em "嗯……那你不能迟到，好吗？"

# game/ep5.rpy:351
translate chinese ep5_bca26eb1:

    # d "Don't worry, sweetheart. I won't. I'll go now, please don't give Mrs. Smith a hard time."
    d "不用担心，宝贝。我不会的。我走了，你可不要为难史密斯老师。"

# game/ep5.rpy:354
translate chinese ep5_1ef01239:

    # em "*giggles* Emy will be a good girl as always."
    em "*笑* 艾米一直都是乖女孩。"

# game/ep5.rpy:355
translate chinese ep5_883c7232:

    # d "Very nice! That's my little, Emy."
    d "很好！真听话，艾米。"

# game/ep5.rpy:358
translate chinese ep5_07f081f1:

    # d "*kisses*"
    d "*亲*"

# game/ep5.rpy:359
translate chinese ep5_ec09f903_1:

    # em "*giggles*"
    em "*笑*"

# game/ep5.rpy:362
translate chinese ep5_7fdcc810:

    # d "I'll see you later, Mrs. Smith."
    d "待会见，史密斯老师。"

# game/ep5.rpy:363
translate chinese ep5_0f6df48c:

    # ms "Mhm! Please take care, Mrs. Meyer."
    ms "好的。路上小心，梅耶女士。"

# game/ep5.rpy:373
translate chinese ep5_9508de14:

    # d "Okay... This should be two days worth of food. Lucky me, I also have a small discount on some items too."
    d "好了……这些应该够吃两天了。而且还都是折扣价。"

# game/ep5.rpy:374
translate chinese ep5_0f7b7333:

    # d "I really am a cheapskate. *giggles*"
    d "我可真抠门。 *笑*"

# game/ep5.rpy:377
translate chinese ep5_70f5ce89:

    # d "I think I'll cook Emy's favorite tonight. She's doing really well in school, but I don't have the money to buy her toys, so at least... this is the best I can give to her."
    d "今晚就给艾米做她最喜欢吃的吧。她在学校里表现很好，但我没钱给她买玩具，这是我能给她的最好的东西了……"

# game/ep5.rpy:378
translate chinese ep5_b2014989:

    # d "I also bought her a couple of her favorite biscuits. I bet she'll be happy when she sees them. I can already see her reaction. *giggles*"
    d "我还买了她最喜欢吃的饼干。她看见了肯定会很开心。我都能想到她的反应了。 *笑*"

# game/ep5.rpy:379
translate chinese ep5_95faf299:

    # d "Let's get these sorted out and go back to h-"
    d "好了，该去收银——"

# game/ep5.rpy:382
translate chinese ep5_b45ae0cf_1:

    # d "!!!"
    d "！！！"

# game/ep5.rpy:385
translate chinese ep5_b04e2d2d:

    # d "*clench* Ngk!"
    d "*抓紧* 啊！"

# game/ep5.rpy:386
translate chinese ep5_7efa1a8f:

    # d "Gah!"
    d "啊……！"

# game/ep5.rpy:389
translate chinese ep5_b7039a1a_1:

    # d "*huff* *huff*"
    d "*喘气* *喘气*"

# game/ep5.rpy:390
translate chinese ep5_bc1d182f:

    # d "{i}This isn't normal... I should go and see a doctor... These sudden pains in my chest are happening too often now...{/i}"
    d "{i}这不正常……我得去看医生了……最近发作得太频繁了……{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:391
translate chinese ep5_25d264e9:

    # d "{i}Just... what is this I'm feeling. I'm sure I haven't had any illness whatsoever before...{/i}"
    d "{i}到底是为什么……我以前从来没得过病啊……{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:392
translate chinese ep5_6d72b807:

    # d "{i}This is quite concerning, I should ask Madam Hera for her assistance.{/i}"
    d "{i}情况可能很严重，我最好也去跟赫拉夫人报告一下。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:393
translate chinese ep5_a5e17f2e:

    # d "{i}I'm sure she'll help me.{/i}"
    d "{i}她肯定会帮我的。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:400
translate chinese ep5_e04ca657:

    # "Two weeks later..."
    "两周之后……"

# game/ep5.rpy:409
translate chinese ep5_19756dcb:

    # em "Mom, what is that?"
    em "妈妈，你在做什么？"

# game/ep5.rpy:412
translate chinese ep5_7307b6bb:

    # d "Hm? I'm writing a letter, sweetheart."
    d "嗯？我在写信，宝贝。"

# game/ep5.rpy:413
translate chinese ep5_758b45d1:

    # em "A letter? For whom? Don't we have phones now?"
    em "写信？给谁写？现在不都有手机了吗？"

# game/ep5.rpy:414
translate chinese ep5_00798b89:

    # d "We do. But I'm writing this for myself. It became such a habit of mine that I'm doing it almost every night."
    d "是的。不过我是给自己写的。我现在已经养成了习惯，每晚都会写。"

# game/ep5.rpy:415
translate chinese ep5_3f4420ce:

    # em "Hm? But what for? Why are you writing for yourself? I mean dad is gone now. So it can't be for him either."
    em "可是为什么呢？为什么要给自己写信？爸爸都死了很久了，肯定不会是给他的。"

# game/ep5.rpy:416
translate chinese ep5_41afc43f:

    # d "{i}Oh, my... I can't believe that she's just five years old with the way she talks!{/i}"
    d "{i}真不敢相信这是五岁的小女孩会说的话……{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:417
translate chinese ep5_16b36af0:

    # d "Listen, Emy... Someday, if you can't express what you want to say through words, write a letter just like this."
    d "听好了，艾米……要是有一天，你没法用话语表达自己的感受，就可以像我这样写信。"

# game/ep5.rpy:418
translate chinese ep5_1a12963e:

    # d "You can say anything you want in a letter. Express your feelings, tell it your problems, anything you want. It's like your friend!"
    d "信里你可以写任何你想说的东西。发泄情绪，倾诉遇到的困难，什么都可以。就像跟你的朋友在说话一样！"

# game/ep5.rpy:419
translate chinese ep5_c49340d7:

    # d "You probably don't understand what I am trying to say right now, but one day, you will."
    d "现在你可能理解不了我的意思，但你总会明白的。"

# game/ep5.rpy:422
translate chinese ep5_3acd3265:

    # em "Woooh~! Really~? Can I try~?"
    em "哇~！真的吗~？我现在能试试吗~？"

# game/ep5.rpy:425
translate chinese ep5_8b74942b:

    # d "Of course sweetheart! Just look how I wrote things here..."
    d "当然可以，宝贝！你先看我怎么写的……"

# game/ep5.rpy:426
translate chinese ep5_cb2f6b73:

    # d "...and there."
    d "……好了。"

# game/ep5.rpy:427
translate chinese ep5_ee179392_1:

    # em "Okay~!"
    em "好~！"

# game/ep5.rpy:433
translate chinese ep5_8e394ea4:

    # "A few moments later..."
    "一会之后……"

# game/ep5.rpy:441
translate chinese ep5_91c98fd2:

    # em "There! I'm done!"
    em "好了！我写完啦！"

# game/ep5.rpy:442
translate chinese ep5_b934ae4b:

    # d "Eh? Really?"
    d "嗯？这么快？"

# game/ep5.rpy:443
translate chinese ep5_c7d7e40f:

    # em "Yep! Read it mom, it's about you!"
    em "是呀！快看看吧，妈妈，我写的是你！"

# game/ep5.rpy:446
translate chinese ep5_40f19e3d:

    # d "Alright, let me see..."
    d "好，我看看……"

# game/ep5.rpy:447
translate chinese ep5_047b2e1b:

    # d "{i}What could she have written at her age?{/i}"
    d "{i}她这个年纪会写些什么呢？{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:448
translate chinese ep5_afb9aba8:

    # em "(Dear God,)"
    em "（亲爱的上帝，）"

# game/ep5.rpy:449
translate chinese ep5_536133b5:

    # em "(I think my mom is great!)"
    em "（我觉得我的妈妈是最棒的！）"

# game/ep5.rpy:450
translate chinese ep5_c6d8ca12:

    # em "(I love you, mom!)"
    em "（我爱你，妈妈！）"

# game/ep5.rpy:451
translate chinese ep5_609b2c83:

    # em "(She's really nice to me. She takes me to places, and she loves me so much.)"
    em "（她对我特别好。她带我出去玩，还特别爱我。）"

# game/ep5.rpy:452
translate chinese ep5_16a4cad3:

    # em "(She teaches me new things every day and tucks me in my bed every night. She also cooks tasty food all the time.)"
    em "（她每天都教我新东西，晚上还会给我盖被子。她还一直给我做好吃的。）"

# game/ep5.rpy:453
translate chinese ep5_7820c2d0:

    # em "(She reads me stories sometimes too. I think my mom is awesome.)"
    em "（她有时候还会给我讲故事。我觉得我妈妈特别好。）"

# game/ep5.rpy:454
translate chinese ep5_b561e194:

    # em "(I hope we can stay like this forever!)"
    em "（我希望我们可以永远这样！）"

# game/ep5.rpy:455
translate chinese ep5_b27e1725:

    # em "(So, God. Please don't take mom away from me, alright?)"
    em "（所以，上帝，请不要让妈妈也离开我，好吗？）"

# game/ep5.rpy:456
translate chinese ep5_9bdbdfcd:

    # em "(I can share half of my Candi biscuits with you in exchange. Hihi!)"
    em "（我可以把我一半的坎迪饼干送给你做礼物。嘻嘻！）"

# game/ep5.rpy:457
translate chinese ep5_18f15d22:

    # em "(Love,)"
    em "（爱你的，）"

# game/ep5.rpy:458
translate chinese ep5_c505545d:

    # em "(Emy!!)"
    em "（艾米！！）"

# game/ep5.rpy:461
translate chinese ep5_b45ae0cf_2:

    # d "!!!"
    d "！！！"

# game/ep5.rpy:464
translate chinese ep5_ad893dfa_1:

    # d "......"
    d "......"

# game/ep5.rpy:465
translate chinese ep5_f81df377:

    # d "*sobs*"
    d "*抽泣*"

# game/ep5.rpy:466
translate chinese ep5_25751075:

    # em "Eh? Mom? Why are you-"
    em "呃？妈妈？你怎么——"

# game/ep5.rpy:469
translate chinese ep5_ee7901ba:

    # d "*hugs*"
    d "*抱*"

# game/ep5.rpy:470
translate chinese ep5_3a68f052:

    # d "Emy... Emy...!"
    d "艾米……艾米……！"

# game/ep5.rpy:471
translate chinese ep5_e9283d5f:

    # em "M-mom? Why are you crying?"
    em "妈妈？你怎么哭了？"

# game/ep5.rpy:472
translate chinese ep5_557c352a:

    # d "*crying* I... won't go away... I promise! Mom will be with you forever... That's a promise!"
    d "*哭泣* 我……不会丢下你的……我保证！妈妈会永远陪着你……我们说好了……"

# game/ep5.rpy:473
translate chinese ep5_49bf4e8c:

    # em "*giggles* I know, mom. You already told me last time. We'll be together even when I marry my prince, right?"
    em "*笑* 我知道，妈妈。你之前已经跟我说过了。我跟我的王子结婚的时候你也会在的，对吧？"

# game/ep5.rpy:476
translate chinese ep5_0176ce54:

    # em "*pats* There, there... Stop crying now."
    em "*摸* 好了好了……别哭了。"

# game/ep5.rpy:477
translate chinese ep5_58b747c7:

    # d "{i}Honestly... This girl.{/i}"
    d "{i}这孩子……都不知道怎么说她好了。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:480
translate chinese ep5_a295c0ac:

    # d "*sniffs* Yes... Yes... We will."
    d "*抽泣*是的……是的……我们会一直在一起的。"

# game/ep5.rpy:483
translate chinese ep5_a5612166:

    # d "Say... Do you want to sleep with mom tonight?"
    d "你……今晚要跟妈妈一起睡吗？"

# game/ep5.rpy:484
translate chinese ep5_ab237a5b:

    # em "Whaa~! Really? I can~?"
    em "哇~！真的吗？可以吗~？"

# game/ep5.rpy:485
translate chinese ep5_0a871ac5:

    # d "Of course, sweetheart. Mom likes to cuddle her little Emy for the whooole night! *giggles*"
    d "当然了，宝贝。妈妈最喜欢一整晚都抱着小艾米了！ *笑*"

# game/ep5.rpy:486
translate chinese ep5_4b1105e0:

    # em "Me too, me too~!"
    em "我也是，我也是~！"

# game/ep5.rpy:487
translate chinese ep5_7ccd4548:

    # d "{i}No matter how smart she may be, she's... still just a kid at heart.{/i}"
    d "{i}不管她有多聪明，她……内心终究也只是个孩子。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:490
translate chinese ep5_8367ea66:

    # d "Come, Emy. Let's go to sleep. You still have school tomorrow."
    d "来吧，艾米。该睡觉了。明天还要上学呢。"

# game/ep5.rpy:491
translate chinese ep5_ec09f903_2:

    # em "*giggles*"
    em "*笑*"

# game/ep5.rpy:494
translate chinese ep5_85a811ea:

    # d "Good night, Emy..."
    d "晚安，艾米……"

# game/ep5.rpy:497
translate chinese ep5_46e8c02b:

    # em "*yawns* Good night, mom..."
    em "*哈欠* 晚安，妈妈……"

# game/ep5.rpy:501
translate chinese ep5_07f081f1_1:

    # d "*kisses*"
    d "*亲*"

# game/ep5.rpy:504
translate chinese ep5_d8c6f8da:

    # d "*hums* Hmm hhmm hmhmmm... Hmm... Hmhmmmnn..."
    d "*哼摇篮曲*..."

# game/ep5.rpy:508
translate chinese ep5_72d46b02:

    # doc "Mrs. Meyer, your test results came back from the labs today and... it's not good, you might want to take a seat."
    doc "梅耶女士，你的化验结果已经出来了，结果……很不乐观。请先坐下吧。"

# game/ep5.rpy:511
translate chinese ep5_fd970a09:

    # d "What do you mean exactly?"
    d "医生，你是什么意思？"

# game/ep5.rpy:512
translate chinese ep5_56493bba:

    # doc "I am sorry to be the bearer of bad news but... you have cancer, heart cancer to be specific..."
    doc "很抱歉给你带来坏消息，但……你得了癌症，梅耶女士。是心脏癌……"

# game/ep5.rpy:515
translate chinese ep5_9f024442:

    # d "Oh god... but... but how?! I never noticed anything and never had any problems before! So... how come now?"
    d "天啊……但是……怎么可能？！我之前从来没出过什么状况，也没得过什么病！怎么……怎么可能？"

# game/ep5.rpy:516
translate chinese ep5_35f3a45d:

    # d "I... I can still be treated, right? It's still not too late, right?"
    d "我……我还有救，对吧？我的病情还能好转吧？"

# game/ep5.rpy:517
translate chinese ep5_131b4cda:

    # doc "...I'm terribly sorry, Mrs. Meyer. I'm going to be honest with you..."
    doc "……我真的很抱歉，梅耶女士。我就说实话吧……"

# game/ep5.rpy:518
translate chinese ep5_6cb9549e:

    # doc "......"
    doc "....."

# game/ep5.rpy:519
translate chinese ep5_6a1fa262:

    # doc "Any form of medication will be futile at this point."
    doc "现在任何形式的治疗都只是徒劳了。"

# game/ep5.rpy:520
translate chinese ep5_2c43df3f:

    # doc "You have been asymptomatic all this time to the point that we didn't notice the cancer cells had already spread all over your body."
    doc "你一直以来都没有表现出症状，所以等到今天发现的时候，癌细胞已经扩散到全身了。"

# game/ep5.rpy:523
translate chinese ep5_c454d1c4:

    # h "*gasps*!"
    h "*吸气*！"

# game/ep5.rpy:524
translate chinese ep5_ad893dfa_2:

    # d "......"
    d "......"

# game/ep5.rpy:527
translate chinese ep5_6788fe33:

    # d "*hics*"
    d "*抽泣*"

# game/ep5.rpy:528
translate chinese ep5_efa0f8b5:

    # doc "But it's up to you, Mrs. Meyer. If you still want to fight it, we'll do whatever we can to help you."
    doc "但决定权依然在你，梅耶女士。如果你想治疗的话，我们依然会尽全力。"

# game/ep5.rpy:529
translate chinese ep5_8d1b6d9a:

    # doc "Although... we can't promise you anything..."
    doc "但是……我们没法保证……"

# game/ep5.rpy:532
translate chinese ep5_28a43091:

    # d "{i}Please, dear God... If there's one thing I'm going to ask of you... Please... let me stay with my daughter a little bit longer...{/i}"
    d "{i}求求你了，敬爱的上帝……如果我这辈子只能请你帮我一件事的话……请你……让我再多陪陪我的女儿吧……{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:533
translate chinese ep5_af9c9957:

    # d "{i}I'm going to do everything I can to fight it. So, please... Please, help me. Even if my chances of survival are slim to none. I'll never know unless I try.{/i}"
    d "{i}我会用尽一切办法活下去。所以，拜托了……求你帮帮我。即使我活下去的希望那么渺茫。但我总要试一下。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:534
translate chinese ep5_9ac20c32:

    # d "{i}I can't... Leave my daughter like this. I still... have yet to... teach my daughter everything... *sniffs*{/i}"
    d "{i}我还不能把我的女儿……就这么丢下。我还……有很多东西……没有教她…… *抽泣*{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:541
translate chinese ep5_abaa5a9a:

    # "The next day in the afternoon..."
    "第二天下午……"

# game/ep5.rpy:550
translate chinese ep5_7275e998:

    # h "Tch! How many times do I have to tell you that you're not supposed to call me 'Madam' now, Daisy?"
    h "唉！我都跟你说过多少遍了，不用喊我“夫人”，黛西？"

# game/ep5.rpy:551
translate chinese ep5_6ef93cb9:

    # h "And Jesus, stop talking to me so formally! You're more than just my servant, you know that!"
    h "而且上帝啊，别那么毕恭毕敬的！我没有把你当仆人看，你也知道的！"

# game/ep5.rpy:552
translate chinese ep5_d1ddaffa:

    # "........"
    "......"

# game/ep5.rpy:555
translate chinese ep5_514d8fea:

    # h "*sighs*..."
    h "*叹气*..."

# game/ep5.rpy:556
translate chinese ep5_cb970f12:

    # h "Well, are you sure about your decision? No matter how much medication you'll take, if your body can't keep up with it, it won't matter in the end."
    h "你下定决心了吗？不管你接受多好的治疗，要是你的身体挺不住，到最后也没有意义。"

# game/ep5.rpy:557
translate chinese ep5_d1ddaffa_1:

    # "........"
    "........."

# game/ep5.rpy:558
translate chinese ep5_6d246e9e:

    # h "No, I'll come and visit you. Let's talk about it more when I arrive. I also want to see how your daughter is doing."
    h "不，我亲自去看你。我到了之后我们再详谈。我也想看看你女儿的情况。"

# game/ep5.rpy:559
translate chinese ep5_4d7bebbe:

    # h "It's been three years, hasn't it?"
    h "都三年了，对吧？"

# game/ep5.rpy:560
translate chinese ep5_07bdde05:

    # "....."
    "......"

# game/ep5.rpy:561
translate chinese ep5_4b0ace0b:

    # h "That's right. I'll come over at once. I'll be there in thirty minutes."
    h "是的。我马上就过去。半个小时之后就到。"

# game/ep5.rpy:562
translate chinese ep5_d1ddaffa_2:

    # "........"
    "........."

# game/ep5.rpy:565
translate chinese ep5_74521f9f:

    # h "Don't underestimate my family's driving skills, Daisy. Haha!"
    h "你完全低估了我们家的驾驶技术，黛西。哈哈！"

# game/ep5.rpy:566
translate chinese ep5_f8eb1428:

    # h "Just stay put. I'll be there before you know it."
    h "你乖乖等着就是了。我马上就到。"

# game/ep5.rpy:576
translate chinese ep5_fe3cf13f:

    # h "See? What did I tell you?"
    h "看见了没？我怎么跟你说的？"

# game/ep5.rpy:577
translate chinese ep5_56279829:

    # d "It's an honor to have you here again, Madam."
    d "您能再次光临真是十分荣幸，夫人。"

# game/ep5.rpy:580
translate chinese ep5_5ee6a68e:

    # h "Ahh! for Pete's sake, stop it, Daisy! Stand up straight, you're not working for me any longer. I did tell you, didn't I?"
    h "唉！老天爷啊，别再这样了，黛西！给我站直了，你现在已经不为我工作了。我都跟你说过多少遍了？"

# game/ep5.rpy:581
translate chinese ep5_befc8521:

    # d "I know but..."
    d "我知道，但是……"

# game/ep5.rpy:582
translate chinese ep5_c0859599:

    # h "No 'buts'! Call me by my name now, will you?"
    h "没有但是！直接叫我的名字就好了，听明白了吗？"

# game/ep5.rpy:585
translate chinese ep5_548d75cc:

    # d "S-sure, Ma-"
    d "当然，夫——"

# game/ep5.rpy:586
translate chinese ep5_426b4ba2:

    # h "Hmm?"
    h "什么？"

# game/ep5.rpy:587
translate chinese ep5_2a730c86:

    # d "Hera..."
    d "赫拉……"

# game/ep5.rpy:588
translate chinese ep5_b64d2a87:

    # h "Good! Keep that up!"
    h "很好！给我记住了！"

# game/ep5.rpy:591
translate chinese ep5_89c5607d:

    # h "Now where is she? I want to see her first."
    h "小家伙在哪呢？我想先看看她。"

# game/ep5.rpy:592
translate chinese ep5_d57885ab:

    # d "Oh, right! I didn't tell her you were coming. She's been looking forward to meeting you since I told her about you the last time."
    d "噢，对了！我还没告诉她你要来。我跟她提起过你之后，她就一直很想见你。"

# game/ep5.rpy:595
translate chinese ep5_27db49f8:

    # d "Emy~! We have a visitor, come and greet her!"
    d "艾米~！来客人了，快出来打招呼！"

# game/ep5.rpy:598
translate chinese ep5_5fbac4f3:

    # em "A visitor? Who is it, mom?"
    em "客人吗？是谁啊，妈妈？"

# game/ep5.rpy:599
translate chinese ep5_08e7fe6e:

    # d "It's Madam Hera. You told me you wanted to see her, right?"
    d "是赫拉夫人。你不是说过想见她吗？"

# game/ep5.rpy:602
translate chinese ep5_25c99039:

    # em "*gasps*! The doll!"
    em "*惊讶* 是娃娃！"

# game/ep5.rpy:605
translate chinese ep5_429502ea:

    # h "Doll?"
    h "娃娃？"

# game/ep5.rpy:606
translate chinese ep5_8a7c2f50:

    # h "Seriously, Daisy. What are you telling your daughter about me?"
    h "黛西，什么情况？你怎么跟她说我的？"

# game/ep5.rpy:609
translate chinese ep5_fa05c017:

    # d "Aha haa... She was very curious and asked me what you looked like. I couldn't find the right words for her to understand and so I told her that you looked like a doll."
    d "啊哈哈……她之前很好奇你长什么样子。我一时没想到什么合适的说法，就跟她说你长得像个娃娃。"

# game/ep5.rpy:610
translate chinese ep5_ab6ec366:

    # h "Jesus, am I really that heartless with you that you have to compare me to a doll?"
    h "我有无情到让你把我比喻成娃娃吗？"

# game/ep5.rpy:611
translate chinese ep5_f9d826a4:

    # d "No! Not at all! You wouldn't have provided us with everything you did if you were one after all. *giggles*"
    d "没有！肯定没有！你要真的无情就不会给我们家那么多帮助了。 *笑*"

# game/ep5.rpy:612
translate chinese ep5_7297edd6:

    # h "*sighs*... Well, it doesn't matter."
    h "*叹气*... 算了，没关系。"

# game/ep5.rpy:615
translate chinese ep5_091dcbc7:

    # h "Come here, little one! I have something for you!"
    h "过来，小朋友！我有礼物要送你！"

# game/ep5.rpy:616
translate chinese ep5_c4af926f:

    # em "Hm? What is it?"
    em "嗯？什么礼物呀？"

# game/ep5.rpy:619
translate chinese ep5_f48b369c:

    # h "Here, it's Mr. Penguin's friend. You can call him Mr. Fox. *giggles*"
    h "给，是企鹅先生的朋友，你可以叫他狐狸先生。 *笑*"

# game/ep5.rpy:620
translate chinese ep5_26b9a2c9:

    # d "{i}She may look cold on the outside. But behind those emotionless eyes, is a warm and kind soul. I never once regretted that I dedicated my entire life to being her servant.{/i}"
    d "{i}她外表看着冷酷，但无情的双眼后面隐藏的是一个热情、和善的灵魂。哪怕一辈子都作服侍她的仆人我也不会后悔。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:623
translate chinese ep5_993704cd:

    # em "Eh? You know Mr. Penguin?"
    em "哇~！你认识企鹅先生吗？"

# game/ep5.rpy:624
translate chinese ep5_58ec0a96:

    # h "Yes, dear. I'm the one who gave him to you when you were born, after all."
    h "是的，亲爱的。毕竟就是我在你出生之后把企鹅先生送给你的。"

# game/ep5.rpy:625
translate chinese ep5_ad4f073e:

    # em "Really? Thank you, Mrs. Doll! I really took care of him!"
    em "真的吗？谢谢你，娃娃阿姨！我一直都很喜欢他！"

# game/ep5.rpy:628
translate chinese ep5_7fd16a4b:

    # h "Tch!"
    h "啧！"

# game/ep5.rpy:629
translate chinese ep5_5bfaacbb:

    # d "E-eek!"
    d "啊，哈哈……"

# game/ep5.rpy:630
translate chinese ep5_d8784058:

    # d "I'm sorry..."
    d "不好意思……"

# game/ep5.rpy:631
translate chinese ep5_cb0cb69a:

    # h "*deeply sighs*..."
    h "*长叹一口气*..."

# game/ep5.rpy:634
translate chinese ep5_041b7219:

    # h "That's good to know, dear. Take care of them both from now on, alright?"
    h "那就好，亲爱的。之后要好好照顾他们两个，行吗？"

# game/ep5.rpy:635
translate chinese ep5_4d9357ca:

    # em "*giggles* I will, I promise!"
    em "*笑* 我保证！"

# game/ep5.rpy:636
translate chinese ep5_ee4c4b81:

    # em "But... Isn't it weird?"
    em "但是……你不觉得奇怪吗？"

# game/ep5.rpy:637
translate chinese ep5_b65bef1e:

    # h "Hm?"
    h "嗯？"

# game/ep5.rpy:638
translate chinese ep5_95dab6ca:

    # em "A doll giving away a stuffed toy! *giggles*"
    em "一个娃娃居然送了我一个毛绒玩具！ *笑*"

# game/ep5.rpy:641
translate chinese ep5_d437fa65:

    # h "Grrr... I swear I'll smack some sense into you later, Daisy."
    h "啊……你给我等着瞧吧，黛西！"

# game/ep5.rpy:642
translate chinese ep5_d1081538:

    # d "I'm truly sorry..."
    d "真的很抱歉……"

# game/ep5.rpy:645
translate chinese ep5_49611c6c:

    # em "But mom is right! You really look so pretty! You also gave me Mr. Pengiun and Mr. Fox, so I know you're a good person too!"
    em "但妈妈说得对！你真的很漂亮！你还送了我企鹅先生和狐狸先生，你肯定是个好人！"

# game/ep5.rpy:646
translate chinese ep5_1a4d399a:

    # em "You truly do love us, don't you, Mrs. Doll?"
    em "你是不是很爱我们呀，娃娃阿姨？"

# game/ep5.rpy:647
translate chinese ep5_c76e36d4:

    # h "Ah..."
    h "唉……"

# game/ep5.rpy:650
translate chinese ep5_ba9c4b26:

    # h "Yeah... Mrs. Doll loves you and mom."
    h "是啊……娃娃阿姨很爱你和你妈妈。"

# game/ep5.rpy:653
translate chinese ep5_ee1c87ca:

    # h "For now, why don't you go and play with your toys? Your mom and I have something to talk about alone."
    h "你要不先去自己玩玩具吧？我和你妈妈有些事要谈。"

# game/ep5.rpy:656
translate chinese ep5_d189130e:

    # em "Hm? Alright~! I'll be in my room then! I'll see you later, mom!"
    em "好吧~！那我回房间了！待会见，妈妈！"

# game/ep5.rpy:657
translate chinese ep5_13cb94f0:

    # d "Of course, sweetheart. But don't play too much, or you'll fall asleep before you eat your dinner, alright?"
    d "好的，宝贝。但别玩太疯，不然吃晚饭之前就睡着了。"

# game/ep5.rpy:658
translate chinese ep5_40245cd4:

    # em "I got it, mom! *giggles*"
    em "知道了，妈妈！ *笑*"

# game/ep5.rpy:661
translate chinese ep5_d6bc9bfc:

    # h "I'll forgive you just this once. Your daughter sure saved your sorry ass."
    h "看在你女儿生得这么可爱的面子上，这次我就不追究你了。"

# game/ep5.rpy:662
translate chinese ep5_af6b891a:

    # d "Aha haaa... Let's go and take a seat first."
    d "啊哈哈哈……我们先坐下吧。"

# game/ep5.rpy:663
translate chinese ep5_9ea46503:

    # d "Do you want me to make some tea?"
    d "需要我泡茶吗？"

# game/ep5.rpy:664
translate chinese ep5_b8f77c8c:

    # h "No, don't mind me. I won't be staying for long anyways. I still have an appointment in thirty minutes."
    h "不用了。我不会久留。半个小时之后我还有事。"

# game/ep5.rpy:665
translate chinese ep5_4919a025:

    # d "Oh, alright then."
    d "好的。"

# game/ep5.rpy:675
translate chinese ep5_a72a50d6:

    # h "Was I really talking to a five-year-old kid? She doesn't talk or think like her age at all."
    h "她真的才五岁吗？我跟她说话的时候完全感觉不出来。"

# game/ep5.rpy:676
translate chinese ep5_983638c5:

    # h "What in the world are you teaching to your kid, Daisy?"
    h "你到底是怎么教育孩子的，黛西？"

# game/ep5.rpy:677
translate chinese ep5_4ed9a1bb:

    # d "Ehm, no... I haven't done anything, really."
    d "呃……我其实什么也没教，真的。"

# game/ep5.rpy:678
translate chinese ep5_bb0934ca:

    # d "I wasn't sure at first. But when she started studying at school, her teacher informed me that she wasn't like the other kids in her class."
    d "我一开始也不确定。但她开始上学之后，老师跟我说她跟班上其他孩子都不一样。"

# game/ep5.rpy:679
translate chinese ep5_904eac8f:

    # d "She's not that exceptional that you could call her a genius or a prodigy, but she can keep up with everything without any problems. Probably way too much..."
    d "她倒也没有厉害到能被称作天才、神童的地步，只是理解各种东西比较快。或许有点太快了……"

# game/ep5.rpy:682
translate chinese ep5_382de7e5:

    # d "Aha haaa..."
    d "啊哈哈……"

# game/ep5.rpy:683
translate chinese ep5_40b1bb45:

    # h "Oh for Christ's sake... She's your daughter, how come you're not sure?"
    h "我的天啊……她可是你女儿，你怎么会不确定呢？"

# game/ep5.rpy:686
translate chinese ep5_6c0bffdc:

    # d "She's been showing some signs, but I wasn't able to confirm it until she had a proper teacher that could push and test her out."
    d "她一直以来只是有些征兆，但一直到有老师能给出专业的意见我才能确定。"

# game/ep5.rpy:687
translate chinese ep5_38aae191:

    # d "What's more, the way she talks started to change when she reached five years old. So I stopped using baby talk."
    d "而且她五岁之后说话的方式也变了。我也不能再把她当小孩一样哄了。"

# game/ep5.rpy:688
translate chinese ep5_f59e509e:

    # h "I see. So she's basically an old soul, huh? Plus, she has the brains, unlike her stupid mother."
    h "好吧。所以基本上她就是心理年龄大一点，对吧？而且，她还很聪明，不像她那笨蛋老妈一样。"

# game/ep5.rpy:689
translate chinese ep5_2d027364:

    # d "Aha haaa... I'm really sorry. But yes, I guess you can call her that."
    d "啊哈哈……真的很抱歉。但你确实可以这么说她。"

# game/ep5.rpy:692
translate chinese ep5_2b49890a:

    # h "What the heck are you apologizing for?! She's your daughter! You should've known better!"
    h "你在道歉什么啊？！她是你女儿！你应该更了解她才对！"

# game/ep5.rpy:693
translate chinese ep5_585a9768:

    # d "I-I'm truly sorry!"
    d "我——我真的很抱歉！"

# game/ep5.rpy:696
translate chinese ep5_fe95f13b:

    # h "Jeez... Stop apologizing, will you? I'm not even angry."
    h "天啊……别道歉了，行吗？我都没生气。"

# game/ep5.rpy:697
translate chinese ep5_00418467:

    # h "But... now I understand why you want to push yourself for her. She doesn't have many friends, does she?"
    h "但……我现在知道你为什么愿意为了她冒险了。她应该没有很多朋友吧？"

# game/ep5.rpy:698
translate chinese ep5_7b1b8985:

    # d "...Unfortunately, she's also lonely at times. She's just so very young still..."
    d "……是的，她有时候很孤独。而且她还这么小……"

# game/ep5.rpy:699
translate chinese ep5_2a26e616:

    # d "I... don't want to leave her just yet..."
    d "我……真的不能丢下她不管……"

# game/ep5.rpy:702
translate chinese ep5_700fdc23:

    # h "I should be the one to apologize. You're one of my closest friends, and yet..."
    h "我才应该道歉。你是我最好的朋友之一，但是……"

# game/ep5.rpy:703
translate chinese ep5_c22b0ffc:

    # d "You've done enough for us, Hera. I know that you're always busy and I honestly couldn't ask for more. I'm supposed to be nothing but a servant to you, but... you took me in as your friend."
    d "你为我们做了够多了，赫拉。我知道你一直很忙，而且我很满足了。我对你来说本来就只是个仆人，但是……你却把我当成你的朋友。"

# game/ep5.rpy:704
translate chinese ep5_d42f3e2c:

    # d "I'm truly honored and grateful for it."
    d "我真的很荣幸，很感激。"

# game/ep5.rpy:707
translate chinese ep5_eeae6a89:

    # h "Well, I don't mind to have at least one idiot by my side. Haha!"
    h "我倒不介意有个傻子陪在我身边。哈哈！"

# game/ep5.rpy:708
translate chinese ep5_12a6135a:

    # h "...I'll do everything I can to help you... So don't leave us, Daisy..."
    h "……我会尽一切努力帮你的……所以你要活下去，黛西……"

# game/ep5.rpy:711
translate chinese ep5_3f38a031:

    # em "{i}Hmm? What could they be talking about, I wonder?{/i}"
    em "{i}嗯？她们在说什么呢？{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:712
translate chinese ep5_3c934261:

    # em "......"
    em "......"

# game/ep5.rpy:713
translate chinese ep5_33f7c2a8:

    # em "{i}Envelopes? There's three of them too.{/i}"
    em "{i}信封？而且有三个。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:714
translate chinese ep5_be32ee5c:

    # em "{i}...I should stop sneaking or mom will get angry if she catches me.{/i}"
    em "{i}……我还是别偷看了。被妈妈发现的话她一定会生气的。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:717
translate chinese ep5_371897d2:

    # d "...just in case, please... The other one is for you."
    d "……这是，以防万一……另一个是给你的。"

# game/ep5.rpy:718
translate chinese ep5_e42c91c6:

    # h "What? Don't you dare talk like that again, Daisy! You-"
    h "什么？我不准你再这样说话，黛西！你——"

# game/ep5.rpy:721
translate chinese ep5_fd7af4d2:

    # d "I know... I know! You heard what the doctor said last time. There's no guarantee to it, my chances are slim to none."
    d "我知道……我知道！之前医生说了什么你也听见了。没有任何保证，我的希望几乎等于零。"

# game/ep5.rpy:722
translate chinese ep5_e5a549cb:

    # d "But... I will still take my chance no matter how small it is. However... just in case..."
    d "……不管希望多渺茫，我也不会放弃的。但是……万一……"

# game/ep5.rpy:725
translate chinese ep5_8a41304d:

    # h "Tch! Alright, I'll respect your decision."
    h "啧！好吧，我尊重你的决定。"

# game/ep5.rpy:726
translate chinese ep5_cd7a2d46:

    # h "But you also know that you can't stay here and will have to be admitted to the hospital, right?"
    h "但你也知道，你不可能一直待在家里的，对吧？马上你就要住院了。"

# game/ep5.rpy:727
translate chinese ep5_3ff90f65:

    # h "You won't be able to spend time with your daughter while you're getting treated."
    h "一旦开始治疗，就没办法陪着你女儿了。"

# game/ep5.rpy:728
translate chinese ep5_a4fd6143:

    # d "Yes, that's why I want to ask you for a favor. Please take care of her while I'm away."
    d "是的，所以我要求你帮我。请一定在我不在的时候照顾好她。"

# game/ep5.rpy:729
translate chinese ep5_265c8e86:

    # h "I know what I need to do, Daisy. You do you and focus on getting better. Emy and I will be waiting for you."
    h "我知道该干什么，黛西。你只要专心恢复健康就好了。我和艾米会等着你。"

# game/ep5.rpy:730
translate chinese ep5_8465a0f8:

    # d "Thank you, Hera. But before that, please give me a week to spend time with my daughter."
    d "谢谢你，赫拉。但在我住院之前，请让我最后再陪我女儿一个星期。"

# game/ep5.rpy:731
translate chinese ep5_de03f61b:

    # h "Are you sure? The more time you delay the less likely you are to survive the treatment."
    h "你在开玩笑吧？现在时间非常宝贵，越浪费就越……"

# game/ep5.rpy:732
translate chinese ep5_8f5dba8b:

    # d "Every second I spend with my daughter will never be a waste. You're a mother too, you know what I mean, right?"
    d "我跟我女儿一起度过的每一秒都不可能是浪费。你也有孩子，肯定能理解我的吧？"

# game/ep5.rpy:733
translate chinese ep5_0e050659:

    # h "...Fine! You got it."
    h "……行吧！我同意了。"

# game/ep5.rpy:734
translate chinese ep5_acc89f95:

    # d "Thanks..."
    d "谢谢……"

# game/ep5.rpy:737
translate chinese ep5_860a48b4:

    # d "By the way, I've noticed since earlier... You look... a bit different."
    d "对了，我之前就注意到了……你看着……不太对劲。"

# game/ep5.rpy:738
translate chinese ep5_2897e1c9:

    # h "Huh? What do you mean different?"
    h "啊？你什么意思？"

# game/ep5.rpy:739
translate chinese ep5_8b91d8cf:

    # d "I'm not sure, but there's something different with the way you look. Are you perhaps..."
    d "我也不好说，但是你的样子我总感觉有点奇怪。你是不是……"

# game/ep5.rpy:742
translate chinese ep5_bf817277:

    # d "Pregnant?"
    d "又怀孕了？"

# game/ep5.rpy:743
translate chinese ep5_c602f7fc:

    # h "!!!"
    h "！！！"

# game/ep5.rpy:746
translate chinese ep5_0ff04f47:

    # h "*chuckles* I guess you really can't underestimate a mother's instinct, huh?"
    h "*笑* 看来我永远不能低估母亲的直觉啊。"

# game/ep5.rpy:749
translate chinese ep5_3c51c67f:

    # h "...Yes, I am. I confirmed it just three days ago."
    h "……是的，我怀孕了。三天前确认的。"

# game/ep5.rpy:750
translate chinese ep5_31a7a871:

    # d "I knew it! Isn't it your third already? I mean it hasn't been long since Miss Freya."
    d "我就知道！这是你的第三胎了吧？而且你刚生下芙蕾雅小姐没多久呢。"

# game/ep5.rpy:753
translate chinese ep5_64a626dc:

    # h "Well... I've always wanted to at least have one little boy. I want him to protect my girls when he grows up."
    h "嗯……我一直都想要个儿子。我想让他长大以后保护他的姐姐们。"

# game/ep5.rpy:754
translate chinese ep5_2d8984d4:

    # h "That way, I won't get too worried about them while I'm away doing business. Haha."
    h "这样我在外面忙的时候就不用担心了。哈哈。"

# game/ep5.rpy:757
translate chinese ep5_14d47fc7:

    # d "If it's a boy, that is. *giggles*"
    d "前提是得是个男孩。 *笑*"

# game/ep5.rpy:760
translate chinese ep5_82eb57b7:

    # h "Hey, who knows? I will have to go back to my obstetrician next month."
    h "说不定呢？我下个月就去找产科医生做检查。"

# game/ep5.rpy:761
translate chinese ep5_338f4ecb:

    # h "But enough about me. I must go to my next appointment now."
    h "好了，到时间了。我得去赶下一个预约了。"

# game/ep5.rpy:762
translate chinese ep5_919c1122:

    # h "You should go and rest already. I know you want to spend time with your daughter, but don't push yourself too much."
    h "你快去休息吧。我知道你想多陪陪女儿，但是别太逞强。"

# game/ep5.rpy:763
translate chinese ep5_49765775:

    # h "I'll be back in a week. Don't hesitate to contact me if you need anything."
    h "我一周之内还会再来。你要是需要什么，直接跟我说就好。"

# game/ep5.rpy:764
translate chinese ep5_aa4740d2:

    # d "I will. Let me see you out."
    d "好的。我送你出去。"

# game/ep5.rpy:765
translate chinese ep5_8995cda7:

    # d "...Wait, should I call Emy?"
    d "……我要不要把艾米也喊来？"

# game/ep5.rpy:766
translate chinese ep5_b252c717:

    # h "No, there's no need."
    h "不了，没必要。"

# game/ep5.rpy:767
translate chinese ep5_5d6b2eed:

    # d "A-alright, then."
    d "好吧。"

# game/ep5.rpy:770
translate chinese ep5_162bb7df:

    # h "One last thing..."
    h "最后一件事……"

# game/ep5.rpy:771
translate chinese ep5_f0a74af3:

    # d "Yes? What is it?"
    d "什么事？"

# game/ep5.rpy:772
translate chinese ep5_2f73cf63:

    # h "You can call me your sister from now on."
    h "从现在开始你可以喊我姐姐了。"

# game/ep5.rpy:773
translate chinese ep5_9afb52bd:

    # d "E-eeh? But I can't-"
    d "什么？但是，我可不能——"

# game/ep5.rpy:774
translate chinese ep5_798f1010:

    # h "No 'buts', Daisy. Also, I don't plan on having you work as my servant anymore. Neither you nor your daughter when she grows up, so survive for us and live a long life."
    h "没有任何“但是”，黛西。还有，我不会再让你做我的仆人了。你女儿长大之后也不需要来。所以，你好好活下去，要长命百岁。"

# game/ep5.rpy:775
translate chinese ep5_c4baf889:

    # h "For me, for your entire family, and even more for your daughter."
    h "不光是为了我，也为了你的家人，特别是为了你女儿。"

# game/ep5.rpy:778
translate chinese ep5_852c97f2:

    # d "!!!..."
    d "！！！..."

# game/ep5.rpy:781
translate chinese ep5_bf0e2e2f:

    # d "Thank you! Thank you so much Madam!"
    d "谢谢你！真的非常感谢你，夫人！"

# game/ep5.rpy:782
translate chinese ep5_c9dfc348:

    # h "Oh, God... How many times do have to tell you that-"
    h "天啊……我到底要跟你说多少——"

# game/ep5.rpy:785
translate chinese ep5_ee6d3354:

    # d "No, thank you... Sis."
    d "谢谢你……姐姐。"

# game/ep5.rpy:788
translate chinese ep5_38e35450:

    # h "*chuckles*"
    h "*笑*"

# game/ep5.rpy:791
translate chinese ep5_51b0994e:

    # h "Good girl. I'm off for now then."
    h "好妹妹。那我就走了。"

# game/ep5.rpy:792
translate chinese ep5_596a2595:

    # d "Please, take care!"
    d "请一路小心！"

# game/ep5.rpy:800
translate chinese ep5_89c4fb6b:

    # d "{i}I'm really happy about her decision, but at the same time I'm quite confused why she decided to let me go.{/i}"
    d "{i}她的决定让我非常开心，但同时我也想不通为什么她愿意放我走。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:801
translate chinese ep5_6ae787e8:

    # d "{i}What made her think of it?{/i}"
    d "{i}她为什么会这么想呢？{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:804
translate chinese ep5_8d2c9a24:

    # d "{i}*giggles* But anyway... I'm sure Emy will be glad when I tell her that-{/i}"
    d "{i}*笑* 但不管怎么说……艾米要是知道了肯定——{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:807
translate chinese ep5_b45ae0cf_3:

    # d "!!!"
    d "！！！"

# game/ep5.rpy:810
translate chinese ep5_b04e2d2d_1:

    # d "*clench* Ngk!"
    d "*抓紧* 啊！"

# game/ep5.rpy:814
translate chinese ep5_6d1f4fb8:

    # "*thud*"
    "*砰*"

# game/ep5.rpy:815
translate chinese ep5_4b3f046a:

    # d "Gah! Ack!"
    d "哈啊——！啊……"

# game/ep5.rpy:818
translate chinese ep5_b7039a1a_2:

    # d "*huff* *huff*"
    d "*喘气* *喘气*"

# game/ep5.rpy:819
translate chinese ep5_5a9d386d:

    # d "{i}No~! Not again! The pain is... getting worse...{/i}"
    d "{i}不好……疼得……越来越……厉害……{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:822
translate chinese ep5_171ea21b:

    # d "{i}...I didn't notice until now, but I'm already getting pale... No, not yet! Not when I'm about to...{/i}"
    d "{i}……我现在才发现，我的皮肤已经这么苍白了……不行！不能在我……{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:823
translate chinese ep5_94508035:

    # em "Mom...? Are you alright...?"
    em "妈妈……？你怎么了……？"

# game/ep5.rpy:826
translate chinese ep5_2acc9b94:

    # d "{i}Emy?!{/i}"
    d "{i}艾米？！{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:829
translate chinese ep5_e5d61cc4:

    # d "Oh... N-nothing sweetheart. Mom just slipped."
    d "噢……没事，宝贝。妈妈只是摔倒了。"

# game/ep5.rpy:832
translate chinese ep5_4935a46d:

    # d "Come on. Let's prepare dinner."
    d "来吧。我们做晚饭吧。"

# game/ep5.rpy:835
translate chinese ep5_c80c3f6d:

    # em "{i}Her hand is cold and sweaty...{/i}"
    em "{i}她的手好凉，还出了很多汗……{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:838
translate chinese ep5_cd27aec6:

    # d "You don't have school tomorrow, right? Say, Emy... Do you want to learn how to cook?"
    d "你明天不用上学，对吧？那，艾米……你想学做饭吗？"

# game/ep5.rpy:839
translate chinese ep5_08a2e250:

    # em "Wha~ Of course, mom!"
    em "哇~我想学！"

# game/ep5.rpy:840
translate chinese ep5_aefe3207:

    # em "But... you told me I'm not ready yet last time."
    em "可是……你之前跟我说我还不能学。"

# game/ep5.rpy:841
translate chinese ep5_60baa34d:

    # d "I think you can handle it now. But~! You still need to be careful when holding a knife, alright?"
    d "我觉得你现在已经可以了。但是~！你拿刀的时候还是要小心，记住了吗？"

# game/ep5.rpy:842
translate chinese ep5_5ab2ec8e:

    # em "You will be with me, so I'm not worried! *giggles*"
    em "你会陪着我，所以我不担心！ *笑*"

# game/ep5.rpy:843
translate chinese ep5_a3f11f9e:

    # d "Jeez... Alright, let's go and cook your favorite again tonight."
    d "好吧，我们今晚还做你最喜欢吃的。"

# game/ep5.rpy:844
translate chinese ep5_15bd7e18:

    # em "Yeaah~!"
    em "耶~~！"

# game/ep5.rpy:845
translate chinese ep5_c2aad03f:

    # d "*giggles*"
    d "*笑*"

# game/ep5.rpy:855
translate chinese ep5_f8196345:

    # d "{i}My, my... She already fell asleep. I told her not to play too much, but I guess she couldn't resist in the end.{/i}"
    d "{i}她这么快就已经睡着了。跟她说了不要玩太疯，看来她还是忍不住啊。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:856
translate chinese ep5_6e1a87ae:

    # d "{i}She didn't even let go of her new toy. This little girl...{/i}"
    d "{i}还紧紧抱着新玩具不放。这个小丫头……{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:859
translate chinese ep5_ad893dfa_3:

    # d "......"
    d "......"

# game/ep5.rpy:860
translate chinese ep5_45fafc6a:

    # d "{i}Hey, Hans... Are you watching over us? Have I... actually made the right decision?{/i}"
    d "{i}汉斯，你在吗……你在天上看着我们吗？我……做的决定是正确的吗？{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:861
translate chinese ep5_e8821bab:

    # d "{i}I wonder... What would you do at this point if you were in my shoes? Because in all honesty... I don't know. All I know is that I have to fight for our daughter's sake.{/i}"
    d "{i}我不知道……假如是你的话，你会怎么做呢？因为老实说……我自己真的不知道该怎么办。我只觉得为了女儿要抗争到底。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:862
translate chinese ep5_d9fb3637:

    # d "{i}She's still so young, too young to be left alone in this world. I don't want to leave her just yet, Hans, I can't.{/i}"
    d "{i}她实在太小了，怎么可能就这么一个人活下去呢……我现在绝对不能离开她，汉斯，不可能的。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:863
translate chinese ep5_aabf51fe:

    # d "{i}She can't even take a bath on her own yet... There's still... so... so many things to share with her for when she grows up.{/i}"
    d "{i}她现在连自己洗澡都不会……还有……那么……那么多事情，我没有教她……她还要好久才能长大……{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:864
translate chinese ep5_60e8acad:

    # d "{i}Our daughter is different from the other kids and as such, she needs a lot of guidance. I'm afraid of what she might become if there's no one to take care of her and guide her through.{/i}"
    d "{i}我们的女儿跟其他的孩子都不一样，她需要有人在路上指引她。要是没有人领着，我害怕她会走上歪路。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:867
translate chinese ep5_c7a86e15:

    # d "{i}......{/i}"
    d "{i}......{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:868
translate chinese ep5_11b46738:

    # d "{i}Can you see how cute she is when sleeping soundly?{/i}"
    d "{i}你能看到她睡着的时候有多可爱吗？{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:869
translate chinese ep5_708a8d1e:

    # d "{i}She may have my looks, but she's so much like you on the inside.{/i}"
    d "{i}她继承了我的样子，但内在却跟你一模一样。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:872
translate chinese ep5_595bc461:

    # d "{i}If only... you were here with me right now, seeing how grown-up our Emy is... I'm sure you would be so proud of her.{/i}"
    d "{i}要是……你现在能在我身边就好了，要是你能看见艾米现在的样子就好了……你肯定会为她感到骄傲的。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:875
translate chinese ep5_31feff7f:

    # d "{i}Hans... Why did you... have to leave us? *sniffs*{/i}"
    d "{i}汉斯……你为什么……就这么走了……？ *抽泣*{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:878
translate chinese ep5_55461a4d:

    # em "Mom...? Why aren't you in bed yet...?"
    em "妈妈……？你怎么还不睡觉……？"

# game/ep5.rpy:879
translate chinese ep5_53ea8ce1:

    # d "Oh... I'm sorry, sweetheart."
    d "噢……对不起，宝贝。"

# game/ep5.rpy:882
translate chinese ep5_930623db:

    # d "It's alright, go back to sleep now..."
    d "没事，快睡吧……"

# game/ep5.rpy:885
translate chinese ep5_98988565:

    # em "Mhm..."
    em "嗯……"

# game/ep5.rpy:886
translate chinese ep5_d2f90ed7:

    # d "*hums* Hmm hmmm... hm hmnn... hmm hmmmmm..."
    d "*唱摇篮曲*..."

# game/ep5.rpy:887
