    # h "You know? Your mom is a very strong woman. She's fighting against her illness right now. So I need you to stay strong and believe in her."
    h "你知道吗？你妈妈是个很坚强的女人。她现在正在跟病魔斗争。所以你一定也要坚强，要相信她。"

