    # em "By the way, did you know that today is Miss Security's last day here? She said that she's going to get assigned to a new place. She didn't tell me where though."
    em "对了，你知道今天是保安姐姐在这里工作的最后一天吗？她说她要调到别的地方去了，但是她没告诉我是哪。"

