translate chinese ep5_9e9eb276:

    # em "Yeah, I didn't get to say goodbye too. I was a bit shocked that she knows my name. Were you the one who told her?"
    em "是啊，我也没跟她告别。当时我光顾着想为什么她知道我的名字。是你告诉她的吗？"

