translate chinese ep5_b540ebb3:

    # mc "You know, I'm really curious. What happened to your mom and dad? I mean, it's so unusual that you're living on your own. Especially when you're just six years old."
    mc "你知道吗，我一直很好奇。你的爸爸妈妈出什么事了？我从来没听说过会有哪个六岁的女生自己一个人生活。"

