translate chinese ep5_dfd63d1d:

    # em "Dad died months before I was born. Mom told me that there was a fight and he saved his close friend, but then got stabbed."
    em "爸爸在我出生之前几个月就去世了。妈妈跟我说当时有人在打架，爸爸为了救他的好朋友，被坏人用刀捅了。"

