translate chinese ep5_7b5ed61c:

    # mc "That's... pretty dark..."
    mc "这可……真……"

# game/ep5.rpy:2736
translate chinese ep5_07615d24:

    # em "And mom died just nine months ago."
    em "妈妈是九个月之前离开的。"

# game/ep5.rpy:2737
translate chinese ep5_db7f108e:

    # mc "Wait, that recent?!"
    mc "等等，这么近吗？！"

# game/ep5.rpy:2738
translate chinese ep5_af330811:

    # em "Mhm... She had heart cancer for a long time. She didn't feel the symptoms until it was in the final stage, so the treatment didn't do her any good."
    em "嗯……她得心脏癌已经很久了。但她到了晚期才开始出现症状，所以治疗已经不起作用了。"

# game/ep5.rpy:2739
translate chinese ep5_93f89d7d:

    # em "Then she came back home instead of staying in the hospital. I thought she was all fine once she was home, but I was wrong..."
    em "之后她决定出院，回家休息。我在她回来的时候还以为她没事了，结果……"

# game/ep5.rpy:2740
translate chinese ep5_80e3acb2:

    # em "She chose to lie to me so that I wouldn't get worried about her. And after just two weeks, that's when she finally had her last breath..."
    em "她为了不让我担心，没有跟我说实话。然后过了两个星期，她就停止了呼吸……"

