    # em "(But that doesn't really matter. I still remember all of the time we spent together no matter how short it might have been. I can just remind you about them.)"
    em "（但这也没关系。我们一起度过的时间可能并不长，但我清楚地记得每一件事。我可以慢慢讲给你听。）"

# game/ep5.rpy:3204
translate chinese ep5_3c97c367:

    # em "(I still love you, [mc!t]. So please come back soon.)"
    em "（我依然爱着你，[mc!t]。请你早日回来。）"

