translate chinese ep5_e50b6321:

    # em "(My hair color has completely changed over the years.)"
    em "（过了这么多年，我的发色已经完全不一样了。）"

# game/ep5.rpy:3216
translate chinese ep5_be56037a:

    # em "(I tried not to bathe in hot water very often, but I still don't know why it faded away.)"
    em "（我已经尽量不泡热水澡了，但我不知道为什么情况没有好转。）"

# game/ep5.rpy:3217
translate chinese ep5_5d27f13a:

    # em "(I also changed my hairstyle last year during summer. It was so hot that I had no choice but to have it cut.)"
    em "（我去年夏天也换了一个发型。实在是太热了，所以我没有办法，只能把头发剪短了。）"

# game/ep5.rpy:3218
translate chinese ep5_c877cf10:

    # em "(Now, I'm sure you'll really lose your mind trying to figure out who I am. Hehe!)"
    em "（现在，我敢说你肯定完全认不出来我了。哈哈！）"

# game/ep5.rpy:3219
