    # em "(You know, I'm thinking of following my mother's footsteps and serve her boss's family just like she did.)"
    em "（其实，我正在考虑要不要继承我妈妈的事业，像她一样去服侍我的家族的主人。）"

# game/ep5.rpy:3220
