    # em "(I'm really so proud of her working so hard. I've tried to ask her boss, but she won't let me. That's quite a bummer, really.)"
    em "（我很敬佩她努力工作的样子。我去问了妈妈曾服侍过的主人，但她不同意。说实话，我有些失望。）"

# game/ep5.rpy:3221
translate chinese ep5_9d10a31e:

    # em "(She said that they have some strict rules that I don't know, and that's why I can't. Or, maybe she just doesn't want me to protect Aine.)"
