    # e "{i}Hey, [mc!t]...?{/i}"
    e "{i}你还在吗，[mc!t]……？{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3371
translate chinese ep5_438eeeec:

    # e "{i}Will we... ever see each other again...?{/i}"
    e "{i}我们……还能再见面吗……？{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3374
translate chinese ep5_2dac9b04:

    # e "{i}I...{i}"
    e "{i}我……{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3375
translate chinese ep5_4e91512e:

    # e "{i}...really miss you so much... *sniffs*{i}"
    e "{i}……真的好想你……{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3376
translate chinese ep5_1ef69f5f:

    # e "{i}But then... I guess... this is my final goodbye to you now.{/i}"
    e "{i}但是……我想……这就是我对你最后的道别了。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3379
translate chinese ep5_1eb4d5f5:

    # e "{i}Although, it's just me expressing my thoughts in these letters. You never got to read them anyway.{/i}"
    e "{i}尽管，我只是把我的感情写在这些信里。你永远都读不到的。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3380
translate chinese ep5_2e958982:

    # e "{i}I need to be strong, I can't just cry anymore. Yeah, I'm not that little Emy any longer.{/i}"
    e "{i}我必须坚强，我不能再哭泣了。是啊，我已经不是从前的小艾米了。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3383
translate chinese ep5_ad6e165b_9:

    # e "......"
    e "......"

# game/ep5.rpy:3384
translate chinese ep5_c24740cb:

    # e "{i}I had so many memories of this place... Now I'm parting ways with all of it.{/i}"
    e "{i}我在这里度过了太久的时光……现在我要和一切都永别了。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3387
translate chinese ep5_ad6e165b_10:

    # e "......"
    e "......"

# game/ep5.rpy:3388
translate chinese ep5_85acc18a:

    # e "Goodbye to the two of you... I guess whoever lives in this place next will have a son or daughter who will be able to take care of you."
    e "二位，再见了……我想接下来要搬进来的人家可能会有一个儿子或者女儿，能好好照顾你们。"

# game/ep5.rpy:3389
translate chinese ep5_ad6e165b_11:

    # e "......"
    e "......"

# game/ep5.rpy:3390
translate chinese ep5_5a8ef22f:

    # e "*giggles*"
    e "*笑*"

# game/ep5.rpy:3396
translate chinese ep5_1778f7b1:

    # "The next year during their final year in high school..."
    "下一年，也是高中的最后一年……"

# game/ep5.rpy:3404
translate chinese ep5_feb30f63:

    # e "Are we really doing this again, Aine? I'm not really sure about-"
    e "我们真的又要这样吗，艾妮？我觉得我们——"

# game/ep5.rpy:3405
translate chinese ep5_ff9c508b:

    # a "Ugh... What can I do? I don't want mother to even threaten to take you away from me. I just can't let her do that!"
    a "唉……我还能怎么办？不做的话，妈妈就要让咱们俩分开。我不可能让她那样！"

# game/ep5.rpy:3406
translate chinese ep5_b0a3e9b3:

    # a "She'll do anything to make me obey her orders — I know it'll eventually come to that point!"
    a "她为了让我服从她无所不用其极——我知道她迟早有一天会用你威胁我的！"

# game/ep5.rpy:3407
translate chinese ep5_a6f4db07:

    # e "If it comes to that point, then I can just..."
    e "如果真到了那一步，我可以直接……"

# game/ep5.rpy:3410
translate chinese ep5_de47cbbb:

    # a "No~! She can take anything away from me, but not you! Never! You and Gwen are my only friends!"
    a "不行~！她对我做什么都可以，唯独不能让咱们两个分开！我只有你和格温这两个朋友了！"

# game/ep5.rpy:3411
translate chinese ep5_014ee5a2:

    # a "I can't lose either of you now!"
    a "你们两个我失去谁都不行！"

# game/ep5.rpy:3412
translate chinese ep5_c04d01a1:

    # a "*sighs* I've done so many things for her already... Just what is her goal this time?"
    a "*叹气* 我都为她做了那么多事了……这次她又想干什么？"

# game/ep5.rpy:3413
translate chinese ep5_9174c25e:

    # e "Who is it this time, anyways?"
    e "这次我们的目标是谁？"

# game/ep5.rpy:3414
translate chinese ep5_a1871548:

    # a "It's a new guy who just transferred to this school. And... well... he's our classmate."
    a "是个刚转来我们学校的男生。而且……他……还跟我们一个班。"

# game/ep5.rpy:3415
translate chinese ep5_747c819d:

    # e "A new guy? How did you know all that information?"
    e "刚转来的男生？你怎么知道的？"

# game/ep5.rpy:3416
translate chinese ep5_4575d17b:

    # a "You know how mother works, right?"
    a "我妈的能耐你还不懂吗？"

# game/ep5.rpy:3417
translate chinese ep5_ffb9be8c:

    # e "Yeah, I guess so?"
    e "好吧，也是。"

# game/ep5.rpy:3418
translate chinese ep5_b614ec92:

    # a "But never mind that for now. Come on, let's go and hurry up to our room."
    a "别管这些了。来吧，赶快回教室吧。"

# game/ep5.rpy:3419
translate chinese ep5_7365e21e:

    # e "Sure."
    e "好的。"

# game/ep5.rpy:3427
translate chinese ep5_17c071ca:

    # a "Everyone is pretty much here. Where is he? I don't see him."
    a "每个人基本都在啊。新转来的在哪？我没看见他。"

# game/ep5.rpy:3428
translate chinese ep5_732a8756_1:

    # a "......"
    a "......"

# game/ep5.rpy:3429
translate chinese ep5_325490a5:

    # a "Hold on... Where's Gwen?"
    a "等等……格温呢？"

# game/ep5.rpy:3432
translate chinese ep5_e1e82d12:

    # e "On the rooftop, of course. You know her."
    e "当然在屋顶上。毕竟是她。"

# game/ep5.rpy:3433
translate chinese ep5_b6f4cdaf:

    # a "...This early?"
    a "……这么早就去了？"

# game/ep5.rpy:3434
translate chinese ep5_99b7eb3a:

    # e "Yes, this early."
    e "是啊，这么早就去了。"

# game/ep5.rpy:3437
translate chinese ep5_756fa1c6:

    # a "Oh, jeez... It's only a matter of time till she's caught by the security guard."
    a "天呐……她迟早要被警卫给抓住。"

# game/ep5.rpy:3438
translate chinese ep5_f4f5a93c:

    # e "The guard? You mean Mr. Johnny?"
    e "警卫？你说强尼先生吗？"

# game/ep5.rpy:3441
translate chinese ep5_3f350d08:

    # a "Yeah!"
    a "对啊！"

# game/ep5.rpy:3442
translate chinese ep5_9a82cb2e:

    # e "She knows him. He's apparently her bodyguard at the same time."
    e "他俩很熟。更准确地说，强尼同时还兼任格温的保镖。"

# game/ep5.rpy:3443
translate chinese ep5_0a6ce1b0:

    # a "For reals? Just when did that happen?"
    a "真的吗？什么时候的事？"

# game/ep5.rpy:3444
translate chinese ep5_194366c5:

    # e "Uhh... Last year, if I remember it correctly."
    e "呃……我没记错的话，是去年开始的。"

# game/ep5.rpy:3445
translate chinese ep5_82a0e822:

    # a "Whoa~! That's cool!"
    a "哇~！好酷啊！"

# game/ep5.rpy:3446
translate chinese ep5_178d2b19:

    # e "No it's not. That just means that she can pretty much maintain her bad habits more freely."
    e "不，并不酷。这只代表她可以更随心所欲地当坏学生了。"

# game/ep5.rpy:3447
translate chinese ep5_b050a423:

    # a "Can't we do anything about her habits?"
    a "我们就不能劝劝她之类的吗？"

# game/ep5.rpy:3448
translate chinese ep5_0fdff157:

    # e "No, we should do something about your mom first."
    e "不，我们应该优先想想怎么对付你妈妈。"

# game/ep5.rpy:3451
translate chinese ep5_eb3fb33f:

    # a "*sighs* Yeah, I guess you're right."
    a "*叹气* 对，你说得很对。"

# game/ep5.rpy:3454
translate chinese ep5_732a8756_2:

    # a "......"
    a "......"

# game/ep5.rpy:3455
translate chinese ep5_7d9c436f:

    # a "Ah, there he is!"
    a "啊，他来了！"

# game/ep5.rpy:3458
translate chinese ep5_0fba19b8_1:

    # e "Hm?"
    e "嗯？"

# game/ep5.rpy:3461
translate chinese ep5_28a57000:

    # e "...!!!!!"
    e "...！！！！！"

# game/ep5.rpy:3467
translate chinese ep5_7f987838:

    # e "{i}I thought I already found the prince that mom told me. But... He's been taken away from me by the thing that we call Life.{/i}"
    e "{i}我本以为我找到了妈妈跟我说过的那个王子。但是……他很快就被叫做“生活”的恶魔给抢走了。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3468
translate chinese ep5_21fb0fd5:

    # e "{i}Memories of the past fade away as we grow older and older, but I don't know why I remember that time so clearly.{/i}"
    e "{i}过去的记忆随着年岁增长，总是会慢慢褪去，最后消逝。但是，不知为何，我却总能清楚地记得那时发生的一切。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3469
translate chinese ep5_5e22c10c:

    # e "{i}So clearly that it makes me want to cry every time it comes to my mind.{/i}"
    e "{i}那段记忆过于清晰，以至于每次我回想起来，总是会忍不住泪水。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3470
translate chinese ep5_b6f7dd72:

    # e "{i}That thing that we called 'Puppy Love' has now turned into a 'Forbidden Love'.{/i}"
    e "{i}当年那“童稚的爱”现在也变成了“禁忌的爱”。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3471
translate chinese ep5_31a39252:

    # e "{i}Might be because I can't be allowed to follow it? Might be because he's destined to be someone else's? I don't know. All I know is that I'm not allowed to love him anymore.{/i}"
    e "{i}或许因为我不被允许爱他？或许是因为他命中注定该爱别人？我不知道。我只知道我已经没有再爱他的资格了。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3472
translate chinese ep5_f84bf782:

    # e "{i}It was my choice. I chose this path of my own volition. I chose to move on, thinking we'd never see each other again.{/i}"
    e "{i}这都是我自己的选择。我以我自己的意志选择了这条路。我当时想要放下他，以为我们此生再也无法相见。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3473
translate chinese ep5_0bcb1af0:

    # e "{i}I told myself I should stop — I should stop it while it was early...{/i}"
    e "{i}我告诉自己我必须停下了——趁一切都还来得及……{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3476
translate chinese ep5_38b9eefb:

    # e "{i}But, this pain inside my chest every time I remember him, tells me otherwise. I could never forget about him no matter how much I try.{/i}"
    e "{i}但是，他的身影，他留下的踪迹依然在我脑海中徘徊。每次想到他，我的心都会抽痛。这份痛楚不断提醒着我，不管我怎么努力，我也不可能忘记他。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3479
translate chinese ep5_f9380f18:

    # e "{i}Now, fate really is very cruel...{/i}"
    e "{i}现在，我终于见识到了命运可以有多残酷……{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3480
translate chinese ep5_bf75a877:

    # e "{i}I had no idea that I would come to a point that I was able to hurt the person that I love and make him suffer using my own hands.{/i}"
    e "{i}我从来没有想过，我有一天必须亲手去折磨我最爱的人，要不断伤害他，让他受苦。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3481
translate chinese ep5_c18acf89:

    # e "{i}At first I was unsure if my decision to move on was right. But now, I'm sure that I was wrong. It's all my fault that I'm in this situation.{/i}"
    e "{i}刚开始的时候，我还不知道我想放下的决定是不是对的。现在，我才知道我错了。错得太厉害了。我落到今天这步田地，完全是我咎由自取。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3482
translate chinese ep5_88666b02:

    # e "{i}I'm the one who turned my life into this mess. No, everyone's lives.{/i}"
    e "{i}我把我自己的生活搞得一团糟。不，每个人的生活都被我搞得一团糟。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3483
translate chinese ep5_143bde39:

    # e "{i}I did see him again, but at what cost?{/i}"
    e "{i}我的确跟他重逢了，但我又付出了怎样的代价？{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3484
translate chinese ep5_de89166c:

    # e "{i}Using my own friend's problem and sacrificing my own feelings just to be near him.{/i}"
    e "{i}就为了能和他共处，我利用了我朋友的困境，还必须隐藏起我内心的感情。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3485
translate chinese ep5_c3f8af28:

    # e "{i}Making a selfish request just to be able to talk to him.{/i}"
    e "{i}就为了能和他说话，就向别人做出自私的请求。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3486
translate chinese ep5_ae5aac04:

    # e "{i}Trying to be selfless for my own personal wish.{/i}"
    e "{i}就为了实现我自己的愿望，要假装无私。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3487
translate chinese ep5_43a9709b:

    # e "{i}Yeah... People may have called me smart, but I'm just an idiot when it comes to love. My feelings for him have turned me into a horrible wreck.{/i}"
    e "{i}是啊……或许有人会说我聪明，但在爱情这方面，我完全就是个不可救药的傻子。我对他的爱让我完全手忙脚乱，不知所措了。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3488
translate chinese ep5_6b83ac4b:

    # e "{i}He's in front of me right now, but what then?{/i}"
    e "{i}他现在就站在我的面前，但那又怎样？{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3491
translate chinese ep5_e4fa9a10:

    # e "{i}I want to hug him, I want to hold him. But I can't... Holding back while seeing him like this every day is like being stabbed by a dull and rusty knife over and over.{/i}"
    e "{i}我好想抱紧他，我好想把一切都告诉他。但我不能那样……每天都与他一起生活，却每天都要拼命忍耐。这感觉就好像一把生锈的钝刀一次又一次地刺入我的心脏。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3492
translate chinese ep5_dd0c1f65:

    # e "{i}It's so painful that I feel like I'm slowly dying.{/i}"
    e "{i}这痛苦实在难以忍受，甚至让我觉得我自己每天都在慢慢死去。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3493
translate chinese ep5_bbfa3b53:

    # e "{i}I want to scream with this agony I'm feeling, but I can't. I can't let him know.{/i}"
    e "{i}我想放声痛哭，把我的痛苦全部发泄出来，可是我不能那样。我不能让他知道。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3494
translate chinese ep5_9cc04d40:

    # e "{i}Because if I do, I would lose the two most important people in my life.{/i}"
    e "{i}因为如果他知道了，我就会立刻失去我生命里最重要的两个人。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3495
translate chinese ep5_0668e85b:

    # e "{i}......{/i}"
    e "{i}......{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3496
translate chinese ep5_24bad025:

    # e "{i}Then, I guess...{/i}"
    e "{i}那样的话，我想……{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3497
translate chinese ep5_a552f4c4:

    # e "{i}I'll just...{/i}"
    e "{i}我就只好……{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3498
translate chinese ep5_64cf5a6c:

    # e "{i}...have to endure until the very end...{/i}"
    e "{i}……一直忍耐到最后的最后……{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3501
translate chinese ep5_c12ae223:

    # mc "Yow, Emma! What's up?"
    mc "哟，艾玛！你还好吗？"

# game/ep5.rpy:3502
translate chinese ep5_d3115362:

    # e "{i}Is it wrong for me to selfishly ask for the impossible?{/i}"
    e "{i}假如我想让不可能出现的奇迹发生，这算是我很自私吗？{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3503
translate chinese ep5_4e708446:

    # e "{i}Is it wrong for me to wish for another chance?{/i}"
    e "{i}假如我想有能够重新开始的第二次机会，这算是我的过错吗？{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3504
translate chinese ep5_9618a39d:

    # e "{i}Because if it's not, and if I could, I would offer my life in exchange just so I could be with him even for a short amount of time.{/i}"
    e "{i}因为假如奇迹可以出现，假如我可以重新来过，我愿意用我的生命做交换，去和他一起度过哪怕很短的一段时光。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3505
translate chinese ep5_a2100b8f:

    # e "{i}That's... all I really ask...{/i}"
    e "{i}这就是……我仅有的愿望了……{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:3508
translate chinese ep5_08c8bb2e:

    # e "...*smiles*"
    e "...*微笑*"
# TODO: Translation updated at 2021-12-11 20:14

# game/ep5.rpy:1103
translate chinese ep5_b47a9c64:

    # h "I got it, you kids stay back!"
    h "我知道了，你们两个孩子先退后！"
# TODO: Translation updated at 2022-05-11 15:45

# game/ep5.rpy:45
translate chinese ep5_b6590265:

    # e "Is the hot water working at this time of the day? We don't have hot water in our bathroom. So I'm using the one in the hallway."
    e "现在这个时间有热水吗？我们房间里的厕所没有热水。我想着去走廊那边看看。"

# game/ep5.rpy:73
translate chinese ep5_6667122c:

    # e "I can barely fit them in my hands now..."
    e "手几乎都握不住了……"

# game/ep5.rpy:224
translate chinese ep5_8d024090:

    # d "It's because you're still too young. Your hands are too small for the knife and sharp things like a knife are dangerous for you."
    d "因为你还太小啦。刀很危险的，会伤到你。"

# game/ep5.rpy:244
translate chinese ep5_d63272c9:

    # d "Madam Hera is our family's boss. We have been working for her family for a veeery long time now."
    d "赫拉夫人是我们整个家族的主人。我们服侍她的家族已经非常非常久了。"

# game/ep5.rpy:343
translate chinese ep5_6ee305ac:

    # d "Please do. If it's beneficial to her, I won't have any complaints against it."
    d "我明白了。如果对她有好处的话，我不会有任何意见。"

# game/ep5.rpy:2468
translate chinese ep5_44501b3c:

    # mc "(Anyway, it's been some time since we last saw each other. I kind of feel that I'm missing something, I just don't know what it is.)"
    mc "（总之，我们已经挺久没有见过面了。我感觉缺了点什么东西，但我不知道到底是什么。）"

# game/ep5.rpy:3267
translate chinese ep5_1b5639ea:

    # em "Yes... I do. I want to follow the same path as my mother. I also want to be by Aine's side."
    em "是的……我愿意。我想和我的母亲走上一样的道路。我也想陪伴在艾妮身边。"
# TODO: Translation updated at 2022-08-15 00:59

# game/ep5.rpy:2019
translate chinese ep5_a57767e0:

    # em "N-no, no, no! You don't ever do that to me!"
    em "讨厌讨厌讨厌！你永远不准那样骗我！"

# game/ep5.rpy:2154
translate chinese ep5_98968c5a:

    # mc "{i}But I wonder why she's always covering half of her face with her hair? I wonder what she looks like without it... I bet she would look even cuter...{/i}"
    mc "{i}不知道她为什么总是用头发挡着半张脸？真想看看她把头发拨开之后的样子……肯定会更可爱……{/i}"

# TODO: Translation updated at 2023-10-04 21:58

# game/ep5.rpy:645
translate chinese ep5_2d8a458d:

    # em "But mom is right! You really look so pretty! You also gave me Mr. Penguin and Mr. Fox, so I know you're a good person too!"
    em "但妈妈说得对！你真的很漂亮！你还送了我企鹅先生和狐狸先生，你肯定是个好人！"

# game/ep5.rpy:903
translate chinese ep5_f50e0e0f:

    # em "Good morning, Mr. Penguin. Good morning, Mr. Fox..."
    em "早上好，企鹅先生。早上好，狐狸先生……"

# game/ep5.rpy:924
translate chinese ep5_a597aa14:

    # em "Alright then! You can watch together with Mr. Penguin and Mr. Fox!"
    em "好吧！那你就跟企鹅先生和狐狸先生一起看吧！"

# TODO: Translation updated at 2025-08-29 14:23

# game/ep5.rpy:1702
translate chinese ep5_7fc97419:

    # mc "... I'm sorry, Klara, Sky. It seems that I've gone ahead of you."
    mc "……对不起，克拉拉，斯凯。看来我比你们先走一步了。"

# game/ep5.rpy:1758
translate chinese ep5_18ab9b0a:

    # mc "{i}What did Klara tell me about that kind of person again?{/i}"
    mc "{i}克拉拉是怎么跟我说这种人的来着？{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:1765
translate chinese ep5_fdf31a02:

    # mc "I'm already eight years old, but I started primary school late as Klara and I always had to change houses or even cities."
    mc "我已经八岁了，但克拉拉跟我经常搬家，所以我入学晚了两年。"

# game/ep5.rpy:1766
translate chinese ep5_07dddb95:

    # mc "Well... I might be moving to the third grade next school year. Plus, Klara is always away so I need to manage on my own now..."
    mc "嗯……下个学年我可能就跳到三年级了。而且，克拉拉总是不在家，我得自己照顾自己……"

# game/ep5.rpy:1835
translate chinese ep5_f3bb3713:

    # mc "... Oh, shoot! I still need to fetch Sky from her school!"
    mc "噢，不好！我得去接斯凯放学了！"

# game/ep5.rpy:1985
translate chinese ep5_1e2c93a9:

    # mc "{i}She's really so cute! Thank god she's not my classmate or I'd be looking at her all day... This is the first time I've met a girl like her aside from Sky.{/i}"
    mc "{i}她真的好可爱！还好她不是我的同班同学，不然我一整天都要盯着她了……这是我第一次遇见除了斯凯以外这么漂亮的女生。{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:1991
translate chinese ep5_ca8d4eec:

    # mc "{i}Sorry, Klara, I lied. Heheee...{/i}"
    mc "{i}对不起，克拉拉，我撒谎了。嘿嘿……{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:2077
translate chinese ep5_2c8fad9d:

    # mc "Yep! Klara was a swimmer back when she was young, so she taught me a lot of things, including how to swim."
    mc "对啊！克拉拉年轻的时候是专业的游泳运动员，所以她教了我很多。"

# game/ep5.rpy:2079
translate chinese ep5_4fa688ea:

    # mc "Klara and I used to come walking here and a lot of people used to come here back then."
    mc "我跟克拉拉以前经常来这散步。之前很多人都会来这。"

# game/ep5.rpy:2125
translate chinese ep5_ebb5414d:

    # mc "Hrrmnn... Five more minutes, Klara..."
    mc "嗯嗯……再睡五分钟，克拉拉……"

# game/ep5.rpy:2126
translate chinese ep5_3fc7685a:

    # em "What? I'm not Klara! Come on, wake up!"
    em "什么？我不是克拉拉！快点，醒醒！"

# game/ep5.rpy:2317
translate chinese ep5_d17abac1:

    # mc "(I have to stop slacking and study harder or Klara will get angry with me. So I've been going home early and studying before the exams.)"
    mc "（我不能再每天到处玩了，不然克拉拉会生气的。所以这几天我每天都按时回家，然后努力学习。）"

# game/ep5.rpy:2318
translate chinese ep5_4b939524:

    # mc "(Klara is really scary when she's angry, you know?)"
    mc "（克拉拉生气的时候特别吓人，你肯定也不想看我挨骂吧！）"

# game/ep5.rpy:2416
translate chinese ep5_e47dc4ae:

    # mc "(Have you been studying well? Sky and I have been studying non-stop for the last three days!)"
    mc "（你学习上有困难吗？我和斯凯这三天来一直都在不停地学习！）"

# game/ep5.rpy:2418
translate chinese ep5_778d088c:

    # mc "(But do not give up! Klara told me it's for our future, so we need to study very hard.)"
    mc "（但是不能放弃！克拉拉跟我说这都是为了我们的将来，我们必须努力学习才行。）"

# game/ep5.rpy:2420
translate chinese ep5_d6555ca3:

    # mc "(But don't call me an idiot! Sky got angry with me because I shouted when I read your message last time!)"
    mc "（但是不准再叫我傻子了！我上次读到的时候气得叫了出来，还被斯凯骂了。）"

# game/ep5.rpy:2454
translate chinese ep5_314010dd:

    # s "Hmf! Stupid!"
    s "哼！笨蛋！"

# game/ep5.rpy:2523
translate chinese ep5_73ae5e47:

    # s "{i}It seems [mc] has totally gone cuckoo! I'll sleep in my room tonight, he's scaring me...{/i}"
    s "{i}看来[mc!t]已经彻底疯了！今晚我要睡在自己的房间了，他真的吓到我了……{/i}"

# game/ep5.rpy:2762
translate chinese ep5_8d632ff0:

    # mc "Klara also told me that we hide our weakness because we want to impress. And we desire to impress because we want to hide our weakness."
    mc "克拉拉也跟我说过，人为了表现自己，会隐藏自己的弱点。而我们总是想表现自己，因为我们想隐藏自己的弱点。"

# game/ep5.rpy:2944
translate chinese ep5_f6ade61f:

    # mc "Yeah, I... I understand."
    mc "嗯，我……我理解。"

# game/ep5.rpy:3010
translate chinese ep5_9f830dac:

    # mc "Mhm! Klara is planning to go abroad next week. And... well..."
    mc "嗯。克拉拉下周就要出国了。然后……嗯……"

# game/ep5.rpy:3029
translate chinese ep5_a94d798e:

    # em "I get that you're still young and she can't just leave you behind, right? I understand... That's alright. Ehe... Ehehee..."
    em "我知道你还太小，她不可能不管你，对吧？我懂的……没关系。嘿嘿嘿……"

# game/ep5.rpy:3108
translate chinese ep5_1bc1d849:

    # mc "Yeah... I think so. I just asked Klara if I could go somewhere real quick."
    mc "嗯……是啊。我跟克拉拉说我只会离开一小会儿。"

